    readme: "# \ud83c\udf10 HTML & CSS Learning Practice\n\n[![Language: HTML5](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-HTML5-E34F26?style=for-the-badge&logo=html5&logoColor=white)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML)\n[![Language: CSS3](https://img.shields.io/badge/Language-CSS3-1572B6?style=for-the-badge&logo=css3&logoColor=white)](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)\n[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE)\n\nA collection of foundational HTML5 and CSS practice exercises, web page layouts, multimedia integrations, and table components.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcd1 Table of Contents\n\n- [Overview](#-overview)\n- [Project Directory & Files](#-project-directory--files)\n- [Detailed Page Breakdown](#-detailed-page-breakdown)\n  - [1. Music Lyrics Player (`music_lyrics.html`)](#1-music-lyrics-player-music_lyricshtml)\n  - [2. Store Hours Schedule Table (`store hours.html`)](#2-store-hours-schedule-table-store-hourshtml)\n  - [3. Introduction & Typography (`prog1.html`)](#3-introduction--typography-prog1html)\n  - [4. Image Display & Layout (`prog2.html`)](#4-image-display--layout-prog2html)\n- [Core HTML Concepts Covered](#-core-html-concepts-covered)\n- [How to View Locally](#-how-to-view-locally)\n- [Author](#-author)\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude80 Overview\n\nThis repository documents hands-on learning with modern HTML5 semantics, multimedia embedding (audio and images), structured tables, and page layout techniques.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcc2 Project Directory & Files\n\n| File | Type | Key Features / Topics | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| [`music_lyrics.html`](music_lyrics.html) | HTML5 | `<audio>`, `<pre>`, `<link rel=\"icon\">`, `<a>` | Song lyrics showcase with embedded MP3 audio player, album artwork link, and custom favicon. |\n| [`store hours.html`](store%20hours.html) | HTML5 | `<table>`, `<tr>`, `<th>`, `<td>` | Weekly store operational hours formatted in a bordered, aligned data table. |\n| [`prog1.html`](prog1.html) | HTML5 | `<h1>`-`<h2>`, `<p>`, `<hr>` | Personal introduction page exploring typography hierarchy, line dividers, and paragraphs. |\n| [`prog2.html`](prog2.html) | HTML5 | `<header>`, `<img>` | Image embedding and responsive dimension attributes. |\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd0d Detailed Page Breakdown\n\n### 1. Music Lyrics Player (`music_lyrics.html`)\n- **Key Concepts**: Multimedia embedding, preformatted text, hyperlinks, inline CSS.\n- **Features**:\n  - Embedded audio player (`<audio controls><source src=\"meddle about.mp3\"></audio>`) allowing playback directly in the browser.\n  - Interactive album artwork linking directly to YouTube Music.\n  - Formatted song lyrics using `<pre>` to preserve line breaks and lyrical spacing.\n  - Custom favicon integration using `<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"me.png\">`.\n\n### 2. Store Hours Schedule Table (`store hours.html`)\n- **Key Concepts**: Semantic tables, table headers, column spans, border styling.\n- **Features**:\n  - Weekly schedule grid mapping Sunday through Saturday.\n  - Clear distinction between table headers (`<th>`) and operational data cells (`<td>`).\n\n### 3. Introduction & Typography (`prog1.html`)\n- **Key Concepts**: Heading hierarchy, semantic body layout, paragraph blocks.\n- **Features**:\n  - Demonstrates proper use of `<h1>`, `<h2>`, and `<p>` tags for content hierarchy.\n\n### 4. Image Display & Layout (`prog2.html`)\n- **Key Concepts**: Image rendering (`<img>`), height/width attributes, semantic `<header>`.\n- **Features**:\n  - Demonstrates image integration with explicit dimensions.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83e\udde0 Core HTML Concepts Covered\n\n```\nHTML5 Fundamentals\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Multimedia & Assets\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Audio streaming (<audio controls>)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Image rendering (<img>)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 Favicon branding (<link rel=\"icon\">)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Structural & Semantic Elements\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Headings (<h1> - <h6>)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Paragraphs (<p>) & Horizontal Rules (<hr>)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 Preformatted text (<pre>)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Tables & Data Display\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Table container (<table>)\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 Rows (<tr>)\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 Headers & Cells (<th>, <td>)\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Navigation & Linking\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 Hyperlinks (<a> with target/title attributes)\n```\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcbb How to View Locally\n\n1. Clone or open the repository folder.\n2. Double-click any `.html` file (e.g. `music_lyrics.html` or `store hours.html`) to open it in your default web browser (Chrome, Safari, Firefox).\n3. Alternatively, use VS Code's **Live Server** extension to preview pages with live reload.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc64 Author\n\n- **Sagnik Nag** ([@sagnikkhaze-lgtm](https://github.com/sagnikkhaze-lgtm))\n- College: *St. Xavier's College, Kolkata*\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcc4 License\n\nThis repository is licensed under the [MIT License](LICENSE).\n",
